{"overview":"فیلم درباره مردی است که در حومهٔ شهر تهران، با اتومبیلش دنبال کسی می‌گردد که تقاضای پردردسر او را در ازای دریافت ۲۰۰ هزار تومان پول انجام دهد...","tagline":"","overview_en":"A middle-aged Tehranian man, Mr. Badii is intent on killing himself and seeks someone to bury him after his demise. Driving around the city, the seemingly well-to-do Badii meets with numerous people, including a Muslim student, asking them to take on the job, but initially he has little luck. Eventually, Badii finds a man who is up for the task because he needs the money, but his new associate soon tries to talk him out of committing suicide.","tagline_en":"","runtime":99,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["عباس کیارستمی"],"crew_en":["Abbas Kiarostami"],"countries":["IR","FR"],"cast":[{"name":"همایون ارشادی","role":"Mr. Badii","photo":"/gBoWtYN8Z8UunnCKVQmebWA0Qv4.jpg","en":"Homayoun Ershadi"},{"name":"Abdolrahman Bagheri","role":"Mr. Bagheri","photo":"/AtFw5qprLGCcDK95SnBse9vyce5.jpg"},{"name":"Safar Ali Moradi","role":"Soldier","photo":"/t9dTsZ9mctpeol4LgzpnT8lO00a.jpg"},{"name":"Mir Hossein Noori","role":"Seminarian","photo":"/9mFN25mefcGRWPEIRCOA5SVaMDz.jpg"},{"name":"Elham Imani","role":"Photographer","photo":""},{"name":"Afshin Khorshid Bakhtiari","role":"Worker","photo":""},{"name":"Ahmad Ansari","role":"Self","photo":""}],"trailer":"ukmYdGwVqPg","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/30020/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"HBO Max Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/64fLWeSyZ1KQZhIdvTdy4QHeWty.png"},{"n":"Criterion Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/32XVilXkVbrwV96O3N5i0rtuyd6.png"},{"n":"HBO Max","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/skypuy7SXuugIQeYg0IglmzoKaS.png"},{"n":"Kanopy","kind":"free","logo":"/cltb8XKan9ierp23ItPmCOcVLRa.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/30020/watch?locale=CA","p":[{"n":"Criterion Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/32XVilXkVbrwV96O3N5i0rtuyd6.png"}]},"DE":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie